discuss the governance and execution of the Business Continuity and Disaster Recovery Program. 
Business Continuity Planning 
Adobe is prepared to handle large business disruptions with its corporate business continuity program, which is driven 
by a Business Continuity Policy (BC Policy) and a Business Continuity Plan (BCP). The BCP provides guidance for 
managing the safety of personnel, assessing impact and mitigation efforts, escalation and execution of disaster 
recovery procedures, and event closure. The plan is reviewed and updated on an annual basis. 
Individual teams are responsible for documenting a Disaster Recovery Plan (DRP) for each of their identified critical 
business functions, which are identified via a business impact assessment. 
