Third-Party Assurance Review 
Adobe performs risk assessments of all third-party vendors and, in addition, performs an annual review of vendor 
assurance reports issued for critical third-party vendors. A listing of all third-party assurance reports, including the 
period of coverage, is documented and is maintained by the VSR team. The team documents any findings and reviews 
the vendor’s management response to each. The team determines the impact of the findings against Adobe’s security 
posture and risk appetite. If the findings have a critical impact on Adobe, the VSR team initiates a conversation with 
the third-party vendors to gain additional understanding of the findings and associated remediation activities. All 
analysis and conclusions are documented. 
